EPISODE 1 \f1\emdash  What Children Need to Feel Safe\par
Key Message:  \par
Children grow best when they feel safe, seen, and supported.\par
\par
Narration:  \par
\ldblquote Every child needs safety. Not just physical safety \emdash  emotional safety.\par
They need to know:\par
\lquote I\rquote m loved.\rquote\par
\lquote I\rquote m safe.\rquote\par
\lquote My parent is here for me.\rquote\par
When children feel safe, their brain can learn, grow, and connect.\rdblquote\par
\par
On\f2\_\f0 Screen Text:  \par
\ldblquote Safety first. Connection always.\rdblquote\par
\par
Scene Descriptions:\par
\par
Child relaxing into parent\rquote s arms\par
\par
Soft home environment\par
\par
Warm lighting\par
\par
Tone:  \par
Gentle, reassuring, slow pacing\par
\par
EPISODE 2 \f1\emdash  Warmth + Boundaries\par
Key Message:  \par
Children need both love and limits.\par
\par
Narration:  \par
\ldblquote Warmth tells a child: \lquote You matter.\rquote\par
Boundaries tell a child: \lquote You\rquote re safe.\rquote\par
Together, they create the balance every child needs.\rdblquote\par
\par
On\f2\_\f0 Screen Text:  \par
\ldblquote Warmth + Boundaries = Safety\rdblquote\par
\par
EPISODE 3 \f1\emdash  Emotional Coaching Basics\par
Key Message:  \par
Children learn emotions from us.\par
\par
Narration:  \par
\ldblquote When your child feels big feelings, they need your calm presence.\par
Naming emotions helps them understand what\rquote s happening inside.\rdblquote\par
\par
On\f2\_\f0 Screen Text:  \par
\ldblquote Name it to tame it.\rdblquote\par
\par
EPISODE 4 \f1\emdash  Understanding Your Child\rquote s Needs\par
Key Message:  \par
Behaviour shows needs.\par
\par
Narration:  \par
\ldblquote Every behaviour has a reason.\par
Hunger, tiredness, overwhelm, fear, or needing connection.\rdblquote\par
\par
On\f2\_\f0 Screen Text:  \par
\ldblquote Look beneath the behaviour.\rdblquote\par
\par
EPISODE 5 \f1\emdash  Positive Discipline\par
Key Message:  \par
Discipline means teaching, not punishing.\par
\par
Narration:  \par
\ldblquote Children learn best through guidance, not fear.\par
Positive discipline teaches skills, not shame.\rdblquote\par
\par
On\f2\_\f0 Screen Text:  \par
\ldblquote Teach, don\rquote t punish.\rdblquote\par
\par
EPISODE 6 \f1\emdash  Daily Routines That Work\par
Key Message:  \par
Predictability builds safety.\par
\par
Narration:  \par
\ldblquote Routines help children feel calm and in control.\par
They reduce stress and make the day smoother.\rdblquote\par
\par
On\f2\_\f0 Screen Text:  \par
\ldblquote Predictability = Safety\rdblquote\par
\par
EPISODE 7 \f1\emdash  Repair After Conflict\par
Key Message:  \par
Repair matters more than perfection.\par
\par
Narration:  \par
\ldblquote You don\rquote t need to be perfect.\par
